if;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:#25245a;\">We bellen je om je keuken, je concept en je ervaring te leren kennen.</p></td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" width=\"44\" class=\"tf-num\" style=\"padding:0 0 18px 0;font-family:Anton,'Arial Narrow',Impact,'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:26px;line-height:28px;color:#f2560a;\">02</td>\n<td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:0 0 18px 0;\" class=\"tf-txt\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 2px 0;font-family:Outfit,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;color:#25245a;\">Proeven</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Outfit,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:#25245a;\">Past het? Dan plannen we een proeverij.</p></td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" width=\"44\" class=\"tf-num\" style=\"padding:0 0 18px 0;font-family:Anton,'Arial Narrow',Impact,'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:26px;line-height:28px;color:#f2560a;\">03</td>\n<td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:0 0 18px 0;\" class=\"tf-txt\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 2px 0;font-family:Outfit,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;color:#25245a;\">Op de line-up</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Outfit,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:#25245a;\">Daarna sta je in ons netwerk en kom je in aanmerking voor events.</p></td></tr></table><p style=\"margin:0 0 20px 0;font-family:Outfit,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;color:#25245a;font-weight:400;\">Benieuwd met wie je straks in de keuken staat?</p><table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" class=\"tf-btn\"><tr><td bgcolor=\"#f2560a\" style=\"border-radius:0;\">\n<a href=\"https://www.thefoodlineup.nl/chefs-netwerk\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:15px 26px;font-family:Anton,'Arial Narrow',Impact,'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;letter-spacing:.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;background:#f2560a;\">Bekijk ons chef's netwerk&nbsp;&rarr;</a></td></tr></table><div style=\"height:32px;line-height:32px;\">&nbsp;</div><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\"><tr><td class=\"tf-line\" style=\"border-top:1px solid #dfe9e8;padding-top:22px;\">\n<p class=\"tf-txt\" style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;font-family:Anton,'Arial Narrow',Impact,'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:20px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#25245a;\">Liever even bellen?</p>\n<p class=\"tf-txt\" style=\"margin:0;font-family:Outfit,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:#25245a;\">\n<a href=\"tel:+31202615235\" style=\"color:#25245a;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;\">(+31) 20 26 15 235</a><br>\n<a href=\"mailto:info@thefoodlineup.nl\" style=\"color:#25245a;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;\">info@thefoodlineup.nl</a></p></td></tr></table><div style=\"height:24px;line-height:24px;\">&nbsp;</div><p style=\"margin:0 0 0px 0;font-family:Outfit,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;color:#25245a;font-weight:400;\">Tot snel!<br><strong>Team The Food Line-up</strong></p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td bgcolor=\"#25245a\" class=\"tf-pad\" style=\"background:#25245a;padding:28px 40px 30px 40px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0;font-family:Outfit,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;color:#ffffff;\">\n<a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/10384742/\" style=\"color:#ffffff;text-decoration:underline;\">LinkedIn</a> &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp;\n<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/thefoodlineup/\" style=\"color:#ffffff;text-decoration:underline;\">Instagram</a> &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp;\n<a href=\"https://www.thefoodlineup.nl\" style=\"color:#ffffff;text-decoration:underline;\">thefoodlineup.nl</a></p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0;font-family:Outfit,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#c6e6e4;\">{{ site_settings.company_name }} &middot; {{ site_settings.company_street_address_1 }}, {{ site_settings.company_zip }} {{ site_settings.company_city }} &middot; Eerste cateraar in Europa met het B Corp-certificaat</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Outfit,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#c6e6e4;\">Je ontvangt deze mail omdat je je via onze website hebt aangemeld voor ons chef's netwerk. <a href=\"{{ unsubscribe_link }}\" style=\"color:#ffffff;text-decoration:underline;\">Afmelden of voorkeuren aanpassen</a></p>\n</td></tr>\n</table></td></tr></table>"
