,'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:26px;line-height:28px;color:#f2560a;\">02</td>\n<td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:0 0 18px 0;\" class=\"tf-txt\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 2px 0;font-family:Outfit,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;color:#25245a;\">Eventinspiratie</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Outfit,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:#25245a;\">Echte cases, van congres tot jubileum.</p></td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" width=\"44\" class=\"tf-num\" style=\"padding:0 0 18px 0;font-family:Anton,'Arial Narrow',Impact,'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:26px;line-height:28px;color:#f2560a;\">03</td>\n<td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:0 0 18px 0;\" class=\"tf-txt\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 2px 0;font-family:Outfit,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;color:#25245a;\">Nieuwe chefs</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Outfit,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:#25245a;\">De nieuwste talenten uit ons netwerk van 60+ ondernemers.</p></td></tr></table><p style=\"margin:0 0 20px 0;font-family:Outfit,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;color:#25245a;font-weight:400;\">Kun je niet wachten? Lees alvast onze nieuwste stories.</p><table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" class=\"tf-btn\"><tr><td bgcolor=\"#f2560a\" style=\"border-radius:0;\">\n<a href=\"https://www.thefoodlineup.nl/stories\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:15px 26px;font-family:Anton,'Arial Narrow',Impact,'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;letter-spacing:.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;background:#f2560a;\">Lees onze stories&nbsp;&rarr;</a></td></tr></table><div style=\"height:28px;line-height:28px;\">&nbsp;</div><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0;font-family:Outfit,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;color:#25245a;font-weight:400;\">Plan je een event? <a href=\"https://www.thefoodlineup.nl/offerte-aanvragen\" style=\"font-family:Outfit,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;color:#25245a;text-decoration:underline;\" class=\"tf-txt\">Vraag een vrijblijvende offerte aan</a>.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 0px 0;font-family:Outfit,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;color:#25245a;font-weight:400;\">Smakelijke groet,<br><strong>Team The Food Line-up</strong></p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td bgcolor=\"#25245a\" class=\"tf-pad\" style=\"background:#25245a;padding:28px 40px 30px 40px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0;font-family:Outfit,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;color:#ffffff;\">\n<a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/10384742/\" style=\"color:#ffffff;text-decoration:underline;\">LinkedIn</a> &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp;\n<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/thefoodlineup/\" style=\"color:#ffffff;text-decoration:underline;\">Instagram</a> &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp;\n<a href=\"https://www.thefoodlineup.nl\" style=\"color:#ffffff;text-decoration:underline;\">thefoodlineup.nl</a></p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0;font-family:Outfit,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#c6e6e4;\">{{ site_settings.company_name }} &middot; {{ site_settings.company_street_address_1 }}, {{ site_settings.company_zip }} {{ site_settings.company_city }} &middot; Eerste cateraar in Europa met het B Corp-certificaat</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Outfit,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#c6e6e4;\">Je ontvangt deze mail omdat je je hebt aangemeld voor onze nieuwsbrief. <a href=\"{{ unsubscribe_link }}\" style=\"color:#ffffff;text-decoration:underline;\">Afmelden of voorkeuren aanpassen</a></p>\n</td></tr>\n</table></td></tr></table>"
